CORE broken-cprover-smt-backend no-new-smt
main_timeout.c
--solver-time-limit 1
^EXIT=6$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ not factored: ERROR$
^VERIFICATION ERROR$
--
^VERIFICATION (SUCCESSFUL|FAILED)$
--
The solver call exceeds the time limit of one second and ends in an error.
The CPROVER SMT2 solver and the incremental SMT2 back-end ignore the limit.
